# Line endings are LF, in the repository and in every checkout.
#
# prettier (`"endOfLine": "lf"`) and .editorconfig both require LF, but a Windows working copy with
# `core.autocrlf=true` converts files on checkout, so a committed file can silently become CRLF and
# `pnpm format:check` then fails on code nobody edited (this is how apps/api/src/mime.ts arrived).
# Normalising here removes the checkout from the equation entirely.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets, never normalised.
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mkv binary
*.webm binary
*.mp3 binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
